Lev 10:1 , Nadab and Abihu, for offering strange fire, are burnt by fire;
Lev 10:6 , Aaron and his sons are forbidden to mourn for them;
Lev 10:8 , The priests are forbidden wine when they are to go into the tabernacle;
Lev 10:12 , The law of eating the holy things;
Lev 10:16 , Aaron's excuse for transgressing thereof.
